Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "UndergroundParkingVehicleFollow" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :StateAnomaly ;
    :hasActor :vehicle1, :vehicle2 ;
    :hasObstacle :roadObject1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1, :risk2 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 .

:vehicle1 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "Following vehicle in red (ego vehicle)" .

:vehicle2 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "White vehicle ahead in underground parking" .

:roadObject1 a :RoadObject ;
    :description "Parking lane markings and walls" .

:weather1 a :ClearCondition ;
    :description "Clear visibility in underground parking" .

:risk1 a :RearEndCollisionRisk ;
    :description "Potential rear-end collision due to close following in low-visibility environment" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:risk2 a :OcclusionRisk ;
    :description "Risk of occlusion due to vehicle ahead blocking view of potential obstacles" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.75"^^xsd:float .

:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.60"^^xsd:float .
```

Identified Risks for each risk class:

Risk 1:
Description: Potential rear-end collision due to close following in low-visibility environment
Severity Score: 0.75

Risk 2:
Description: Risk of occlusion due to vehicle ahead blocking view of potential obstacles
Severity Score: 0.60